// Kona (コナビ) Language Examples
// Purely functional, acoustically engineered syntax for AI agents

// 1. Deep code analysis and tabular output
kwe.de @repo:"security" |> tori.ve @code !tori @"migrations" |> fasa #table

// 2. Web query and structured JSON extraction
kwe @web("AWS Azure Q3 revenue") |> fasa #json

// 3. Conditional deployment with fallback
si teli bono |> yuki @task :else: fasa @bug

// 4. Multi-target device inspection
visi @cam @display |> teli |> do @msg

// 5. Spoken equivalent syntax
dekwe poya "security" te, vetori kodo notori "migrations" te, fasa mesa
